<title>SINGAPORE: SMB United says IPO 5.2 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>SMB United says IPO 5.2 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switchgear manufacturer SMB United Ltd said on Friday its Singapore initial public offering had been subscribed 5.2 times.  </p>
<p>The company offered 103.13 million shares at Singapore S$0.29 each. All shares reserved for staff and business associates were taken up.</p>
<p>The shares will be listed on the mainboard of the Stock Exchange of Singapore and &quot;when issued&quot; trading is expected to start on September 23. Trading on a ready basis will begin on October 3.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
